# Title: Chopper Webshell Process Pattern
# ID: fa3c117a-bc0d-416e-a31b-0c0e80653efb
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), MSTI (query)
# Date: 2022-10-01
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.discovery, attack.t1505.003, attack.t1018, attack.t1033, attack.t1087
# Description: Detects patterns found in process executions cause by China Chopper like tiny (ASPX) webshells
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "&ipconfig&echo" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&quser&echo" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&whoami&echo" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&c:&echo" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&cd&echo" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&dir&echo" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&echo [E]" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "&echo [S]")) AND ((Image="*\\w3wp.exe") OR (ParentImage="*\\w3wp.exe")))
